<div class="machine-card machine">
<img src="images/jcb3dx.jpg"
alt="JCB 3DX"
class="machine-image">
        <h3>JCB 3DX EcoMAX</h3>

        <p><b>Engine:</b> JCB EcoMAX 68.6 kW</p>

        <p><b>Fuel Consumption:</b> 6 - 8 Liters/hour</p>

        <p><b>Best Usage:</b></p>

        <ul>
            <li>Excavation</li>
            <li>Loading</li>
            <li>Trenching</li>
            <li>Road works</li>
        </ul>

        <p><b>Performance:</b> Excellent fuel economy and high torque.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="machine-card machine">

    <img src="images/sd300.jpg"
    alt="SD300"
    class="machine-image">

    <h3>SD300 Wheel Loader</h3>

</div>

        <p><b>Operating Weight:</b> 10,000 kg</p>

